From d826333d65b2a2b3b5ae91b9f75a1b49c932b83b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maalh <sometimes7799s@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 15:00:36 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/20] feat(web): demo hub, presenter guided tour and a motion
 layer

The hub at / gives every user a distinct link and starts the tour. The guide
(?tour=demo, ?tour=features, Alt+G) walks a presenter through the story with a
spotlight, talking points and honest notes. motion.css adds restrained,
reduced-motion-safe page and card motion. Guard wording matches the evidence:
75 of 75 synthetic attacks denied in the latest HTTP measurement, an archived
evaluation allowed 12 of 25, and end-to-end safety is not proven.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
